Thou art hiding something, thanks.
Thou art hiding something, methinks.

103
00:15:20,698 --> 00:15:23,108
What dost thou not want us to know about these woods?

104
00:15:23,858 --> 00:15:26,568
Tell us more about this hag.

105
00:15:27,138 --> 00:15:30,958
Ay! A frightful yawn doth excite my spirit!
Ay! A frightful yarn doth excite my spirit!

106
