108
00:15:37,798 --> 00:15:47,408
Gumi and her friend Darla were adventurers who gathered fruit in these woods.

109
00:15:47,908 --> 00:15:55,798
Gumi had heard of a trove of berries hidden deep in the forest, so they ventured in and found a grove untouched by man or beast.

110
00:15:55,968 --> 00:15:59,528
They began picking the berries in pure bliss...

111
00:15:59,808 --> 00:16:03,348
...that is, until they heard a loud, snapping and crunching sound.

112
00:16:03,978 --> 00:16:04,478
What was that?

113
00:16:04,838 --> 00:16:10,538
Spooked by the unnatural sound, they decided to leave. But 'twas too late; they lost track of time.

114
00:16:10,688 --> 00:16:14,368
Night had fallen, and darkness shrouded the woods.

115
00:16:14,528 --> 00:16:19,488
They split up and marked their path with berries. After some time,

116
00:16:19,668 --> 00:16:23,538
Gumi heard a scream followed by a bone-chilling crunch.

117
00:16:24,108 --> 00:16:33,368
Gumi ran down the berry trail with all the haste she could muster. The berries underfoot began to ooze a strange red substance. It seeped into the ground, each stain bigger than the last.
