Won't lose to anyone, always ranked number one, aren't I a beautiful child? (Hey,)

344
00:46:00,110 --> 00:46:05,072
I'm better than her - I'm better than him, oh everyone, come round and gawk at perfection!

345
00:46:06,110 --> 00:46:08,072
Meeting you right after school,

346
00:46:09,110 --> 00:46:11,072
I'm finally confessing to you

347
00:46:12,110 --> 00:46:15,072
Ain't it too good to be true?

348
00:46:16,110 --> 00:46:21,072
A girl, like me, in love with you - who's miserable, vulgar, and crude!

349
00:46:22,110 --> 00:46:27,072
Give me your love, all of your love, give me your love - You can have everything

350
00:46:28,110 --> 00:46:33,072
If I have you, I can have you - shoulder my load, now yours to behold

351
00:46:34,110 --> 00:46:40,072
Still not enough, you're not enough - never enough. Still I won't loosen my hold

352
00:46:44,110 --> 00:46:46,072
Truly, I'm so sorry.

353
00:46:47,110 --> 00:46:58,072
Give me your love, all of your love, give me your love - all you can conjure up Give me your love, all of your love, till you go mad with ecstasy

354
00:46:59,110 --> 00:47:08,072
I know it hurts - (it) only gets worse - God how it hurts - Soon you'll be craving the pain

355
00:47:09,110 --> 00:47:17,072
This is my happiness now!

356
00:47:18,110 --> 00:47:24,072
Ah!

357
00:47:34,110 --> 00:47:41,072
This is my happiness now!

358
00:48:13,072 --> 00:48:17,572
I know not how thou fared, but I was successful in my venture.

359
00:48:18,072 --> 00:48:20,072
More trinkets for thy thrift shop?

360
00:48:20,572 --> 00:48:26,072
Uh, nay! 'Twas coin we needed, was it not? I merely took out a small loan from the bank. Tis shan't mind.

361
00:48:27,572 --> 00:48:35,072
I acquired some healing potions. Luckily, 'twas a simple matter to trade for some of these jewels I found in the woods.

362
00:48:36,072 --> 00:48:40,572
Thou liar! 'Twas thou who took my bag! Thou misapprehended this to me! I merely found these lying on the floor of the forest.

363
00:48:46,072 --> 00:48:50,072
Mayhaps there was a bag. Confess about stealing my stuff!

364
00:48:51,072 --> 00:49:01,072
Does every bag that happens to fall in the wood belong to thee? Arisa is always acting selfishly. She's the newest, so 'twas probably her! Thou darest to accuse me!
Does every bag that happens to fall in the wood belong to thee? Areza is always acting selfishly. She's the newest, so 'twas probably her! Thou darest to accuse me!

365
00:49:02,072 --> 00:49:09,572
If thou wert truly innocent, would the thief not more likely be Hexa? She is simple and craven and acted half-mad back there in the forest.

366
00:49:10,072 --> 00:49:14,072
Me? Why art thou accusing me? It could be none but Falin with her strange obsession with Namu.

367
00:49:18,572 --> 00:49:22,572
Can I just have the bag thou foundest in the forest?

368
00:49:23,072 --> 00:49:26,572
Nay, 'tis mine!

369
00:49:27,072 --> 00:49:33,572
I knew 'twas folly to undertake this quest with you all! Fie on you! Fie on you all!

370
00:49:34,072 --> 00:49:47,072
Myself all on thee, thou wretch and a witless womanizer! I saw thy pathetic attempts at charming innocent choir girls! Better to apply thy sorcery upon thyself, that thou might vanish to the betterment of the world!

371
00:49:48,072 --> 00:49:54,572
Me? My romantic diversions deserve no concern to thee, thou encrusted mud-cake field rat!

372
00:49:55,072 --> 00:49:59,072
Toss to thou and be my companions of flesh, when thine face...

373
00:50:00,160 --> 00:50:04,400
命を この手で全て、終わらせたい ――巡る世界に やすらぎと祝福を――
I want to end everything with my own hands... Bringing peace and blessings to this revolving world...

374
00:50:04,580 --> 00:50:08,920
光を、運命を、闇を、解き放て――
Unleash the light, the fate, the darkness...

375
00:50:09,200 --> 00:50:13,680
終わらない絶望を 歌声に 変えて――
Turn unending despair into song...

376
00:50:13,960 --> 00:50:19,560
叫び続けて 滅びる運命なら ――ただ、祈る――
If our fate is to perish while continuing to cry out... Just praying...

377
00:50:19,840 --> 00:50:25,200
せめて今、弔いの ――果てしなく、遠く遠く――
At least now, a funeral dirge... Endless, far, far away...

378
00:50:25,480 --> 00:50:30,480
歌よ 響け
Song, resound!

379
00:50:30,760 --> 00:50:36,320
巡り巡る世界に やすらぎと祝福を
Bringing peace and blessings to this revolving world...

380
00:50:36,600 --> 00:50:41,880
光を、運命を、闇を、解き放て
Unleash the light, the fate, the darkness...

381
00:50:42,160 --> 00:50:47,440
終わらない絶望を 歌声に 変えて
Turn unending despair into song...

382
00:50:47,720 --> 00:50:52,520
報われずに 君は朽ちていくの? ――ただ、祈る――
Will you wither away without reward? —Just praying—

383
00:50:52,800 --> 00:50:57,160
救いたい、ただ君だけを 守りたい、この世界――
I want to save you, to protect only you in this world...

384
00:50:57,440 --> 00:51:03,240
想いは 交わらない
Our feelings will never intersect.

385
00:51:03,520 --> 00:51:09,120
命を この手で全て、終わらせたい ――巡る世界に やすらぎと祝福を――
I want to end everything with my own hands... Bringing peace and blessings to this revolving world...

386
00:51:09,400 --> 00:51:14,760
ああ 届かない 伝わらないよ――
Ah, it doesn't reach, it won't get through...

387
00:51:15,040 --> 00:51:20,520
願いは虚しだけを残して ――何故? 全て奪われ――
Leaving behind only empty wishes... Why? Everything was taken away...

388
00:51:20,800 --> 00:51:26,560
未来を照らして――
Illuminating the future...

389
00:51:26,840 --> 00:51:32,480
痛み、苦しみ、背負わざれど… ――永遠に続くレクイエム――
Even if burdened with pain and suffering... An eternally continuing requiem...

390
00:51:32,760 --> 00:51:37,520
抗えない運命を ――光を、運命を――
An unyielding fate... The light, the fate...

391
00:51:37,800 --> 00:51:43,160
全て今、解き放つ ――闇を、解き放つ――
Release everything now... Release the darkness...

392
00:51:49,080 --> 00:51:53,760
何故? 全て奪われ ――未来を照らして――
Why? Everything taken away... Illuminating the future...

393
00:51:54,040 --> 00:51:58,840
痛み、苦しみ、背負わざれど… ――永遠に続くレクイエム――
Even if burdened with pain and suffering... An eternally continuing requiem...

394
00:51:59,120 --> 00:52:04,440
抗えない運命を ――光を、運命を―― 全て今、解き放つ ――闇を、解き放つ――
An unyielding fate... The light, the fate... Release everything now... Release the darkness...

395
00:52:36,080 --> 00:52:39,080
君が望んだのは?
What is it you desired?

396
00:52:39,360 --> 00:52:43,000
あなたの未来… 俺が望んだのは…何故? 戻らぬ日々…
Your future... What I desired... Why? Days that will never return...

397
00:52:43,280 --> 00:52:48,920
追い続けたのは 優しい笑顔 それだけなのに
What I kept chasing was a gentle smile... Even though that was all...

398
00:52:49,200 --> 00:52:55,280
終わらない絶望を 希望に変えて 叫び続けて 滅びる運命なら ――ただ、祈る――
Turning endless despair into hope... If our fate is to perish while continuing to cry out... Just praying...

399
00:52:55,560 --> 00:53:00,200
せめて今、弔いの ――果てしなく、遠く遠く――
At least now, a funeral dirge... Endless, far, far away...

400
00:53:00,480 --> 00:53:04,680
歌よ 響け
Song, resound!

401
00:53:07,880 --> 00:53:14,360
巡り巡る世界に やすらぎと祝福を
Bringing peace and blessings to this revolving world...

402
00:53:14,640 --> 00:53:20,440
光を、運命を、闇を、解き放て
Unleash the light, the fate, the darkness...

403
00:53:20,720 --> 00:53:25,200
終わらない絶望を 歌声に 変えて
Turn unending despair into song...

404
00:53:25,480 --> 00:53:32,480
報われずに 君は朽ちていくの? ――ただ、祈る―― せめて今、弔いの ――果てしなく、遠く遠く―― 歌よ 響け
Will you wither away without reward? —Just praying— At least now, a funeral dirge... Endless, far, far away... Song, resound!

405
00:53:37,080 --> 00:53:42,680
君が望んだのは… 俺が望んだのは…
What you desired... What I desired...

406
00:53:43,080 --> 00:53:49,880
残された声は 嘆き 君を想いながら
The voice left behind, lamenting while thinking of you...

407
00:53:50,160 --> 00:53:58,080
独り、君のために歌う 独り、君のために歌う
Alone, I sing for you. Alone, I sing for you.

408
00:53:59,080 --> 00:54:05,640
命を この手で全て、眠らせたら ――巡る世界に やすらぎと祝福を――
If I put everything to sleep with my own hands... Bringing peace and blessings to this revolving world...

409
00:54:05,920 --> 00:54:12,440
ああ、朽ちていく運命は終わり… この身は 君とならどこまででも…
Ah, the fate of withering away ends here... This body, with you, anywhere...

410
00:54:12,720 --> 00:54:19,480
はじまる声 全て叶えて ――未来を照らして―― 滅び、散り行く この身とともに ――永遠に続くレクイエム――
Fulfilling all beginning voices —Illuminating the future— Perishing and scattering along with this body —An eternally continuing requiem—

411
00:54:19,760 --> 00:54:26,480
抗えない運命を ――光を、運命を―― 全て今、解き放つ ――闇を、解き放つ――
An unyielding fate... The light, the fate... Release everything now... Release the darkness...

